SUMMARY:[Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition][Machine Learning] WACV 2027
  - Round 1 new-paper enrollment deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of
  Computer Vision\nWebsite: https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027\nSour
 ce URL: https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers\nLocation:
  Lake Buena Vista\, Florida\, USA\nTopics: Computer Vision & Pattern Reco
 gnition\, Machine Learning\, Deep Representation Learning\nSize: XL\nSubm
 ission type: Paper-based / two independent submission rounds\nConfidence:
  confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official CFP confirms s
 eparate enrollment gates for both new-paper rounds at 23:59 AoE. Both are
  already closed despite the future camera-ready deadline. Main conference
  is January 6-8 at Disney Springs\; workshops run January 4-5. XL is an e
 ditorial estimate\, not an acceptance-rate proxy.\nScope: Applied compute
 r vision and visual learning\, with an emphasis on practical recognition\
 , detection\, segmentation\, image/video analysis\, 3D perception\, and d
 eployable visual systems. Human analysis and multimodal visual methods ar
 e established areas. Compared with the flagship trio\, WACV particularly 
 welcomes meaningful application-driven contributions supported by sound e
 valuation\; its two submission rounds are routes\, not different fields.\
 nAdditional topics: Signal Processing\, Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Mult
 imedia Learning & Retrieval\nScope sources (2027): https://wacv.thecvf.co
 m/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers
END:VEVENT
